{
  "_comment": [
    "The machine-readable half of docs/drtmle/study-manifest.md's artefact tables.",
    "Two representations of one record, which is a duplication and is deliberate: a shell",
    "script cannot check a digest it has to parse out of a markdown table, and a reader",
    "cannot audit a study from a JSON file. What keeps them from drifting is",
    "tests/unit/test_evidence_manifest.py, which asserts the two cover each other in both",
    "directions -- a row here with no row there fails, and so does the reverse.",
    "",
    "`sha256` is the GitHub Actions API's digest of the artefact **zip**, which is the byte",
    "stream scripts/fetch_evidence.sh fetches. It is not the digest of the unpacked JSONL,",
    "and the command that used to be documented here hashed the latter against the former."
  ],
